resources.string:
Dear user, welcome to Fake Call!

Please read all terms of the Privacy Policy carefully before use. We will strictly abide by the terms you agree to:

1. To provide the app's core functionality, we collect and use necessary information;
2. With your explicit consent, we may request overlay permission and wake-up permission to simulate a realistic incoming call experience. You have the right to deny any of these permissions;
3. We employ advanced security measures to protect your information.
